            "title": "China's yuan extends slump amid trade concerns",
            "snippets": [
              "The Chinese yuan continued its slump on Tuesday, touching its weakest levels in almost 11 months amid elevated concerns over a trade spat between China and the U.S.\n\nSkip Navigation\n\nMarkets\n\nBusiness\n\nInvesting\n\nTech\n\nPolitics & Policy\n\nVideo\n\nWatchlist\n\nInvesting Club\n\nJoin IC\n\nPRO\n\nJoin Pro\n\nLivestream\n\nCurrencies",
